@Host = http://localhost:5139

### 1. Record Successful Login Audit
POST {{Host}}/api/audit/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_user",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.1.100",
  "success": true
}

### 2. Record Failed Login Audit (Warning)
POST {{Host}}/api/audit/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hacker_attempt",
  "ipAddress": "10.0.0.99",
  "success": false
}

### 3. Record Admin Action Audit
POST {{Host}}/api/audit/action
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "super_admin",
  "actionName": "DELETE_USER",
  "resourceId": "USR-8822",
  "details": "Deleted inactive account per GDPR request"
}

### 4. Health Check
GET {{Host}}/api/audit/health
